meta {
  name: 13 - Reject Replay Attack With Used Token
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/store/orders/{{transferOrderId}}/transfer/accept
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{customerToken}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "token": "{{transferToken}}"
  }
}

tests {
  test("400/404 Rejected on Replay Attack", function () {
    expect([400, 404]).to.include(res.getStatus());
  });
}

docs {
  # 13 - Reject Replay Attack With Used Token

  Kiem thu phong thu tan cong phat lai (Anti-Replay Attack):
  Gui lai chinh xac token hop le vua su dung o buoc truoc. He thong phai tu choi vi `order_change` tuong ung da duoc danh dau `confirmed` va token da bi vo hieu hoa vinh vien.
}
